From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:21:25 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 112/115] Meridian: a lighter command bar, as in Arc; it finds
 Meridian's own features ("workspace": the Workbench)

The card is narrower with a 16px field and 34px rows in 13px text, a soft
tint for the picked row, a light dim behind it, and the suggestions shaped
like the other rows. Typing a feature's name or a word for it lists it under
"Meridian" at the top, picked for Return when a word starts that way.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
